1
00:02:56,905 --> 00:02:58,345
The Shu road is steep,

2
00:02:58,425 --> 00:03:00,585
harder than climbing green mountains.

3
00:03:00,665 --> 00:03:01,705
Cut it out.

4
00:03:01,785 --> 00:03:02,945
You're reading it wrong.

5
00:03:08,705 --> 00:03:10,105
You scared me to death.

6
00:03:10,185 --> 00:03:11,865
I thought my mom suddenly came back.

7
00:03:12,945 --> 00:03:14,505
Officer Ran, what is it?

8
00:03:15,705 --> 00:03:17,465
<i>GAOKAO SECRETS</i>
HIGH SCHOOL CHINESE FULL REVIEW GUIDE

9
00:03:19,105 --> 00:03:19,945
Du Mingliang.

10
00:03:20,025 --> 00:03:22,225
Someone saw you hanging
around the building all day,

11
00:03:22,305 --> 00:03:23,265
acting suspicious.

12
00:03:23,345 --> 00:03:25,385
They think you've been
stealing women's underwear,

13
00:03:25,465 --> 00:03:27,665
stockings, and high heels.

14
00:03:27,745 --> 00:03:28,945
Who's spreading that nonsense?

15
00:03:29,745 --> 00:03:32,225
Officer Ran, I'm not some fetishist.

16
00:03:32,305 --> 00:03:33,665
My mom's going through menopause.

17
00:03:33,745 --> 00:03:35,185
She keeps nagging me about gaming,

18
00:03:35,265 --> 00:03:36,785
so now I spend my days

19
00:03:36,865 --> 00:03:38,025
playing cat and mouse
with her in the hallway.

20
00:03:38,665 --> 00:03:39,745
Do you remember?

21
00:03:39,825 --> 00:03:42,145
Back then, you even mistook me
for a Pattia hostess.

22
00:03:51,265 --> 00:03:53,025
I swear on everything I own,

23
00:03:53,105 --> 00:03:55,465
I'm absolutely not a pervert.

24
00:03:56,065 --> 00:03:57,465
Then who do you think it is?

25
00:04:02,505 --> 00:04:03,625
Du Mingliang.

26
00:04:10,185 --> 00:04:12,585
Du Mingliang. You've got some nerve.

27
00:04:12,665 --> 00:04:15,505
You played games until you ranked
dead last in school,

28
00:04:15,585 --> 00:04:18,624
and now you've even brought
the police right to the door.

29
00:04:18,705 --> 00:04:20,105
You really think
I won't beat you senseless?

30
00:04:20,184 --> 00:04:20,865
-Please…
-Beat you senseless?

31
00:04:20,944 --> 00:04:23,105
-Mrs. Du, it's a misunderstanding.
-Officer Ran,

32
00:04:23,185 --> 00:04:26,225
did he do something wrong?

33
00:04:26,305 --> 00:04:29,025
It's a misunderstanding.
I'm just here to ask Du a few questions.

34
00:04:34,945 --> 00:04:36,385
About what?

35
00:04:36,985 --> 00:04:37,905
It's about…

36
00:04:38,505 --> 00:04:39,745
The severed head case?

37
00:04:46,705 --> 00:04:47,945
Let me tell you,

38
00:04:48,025 --> 00:04:49,265
years ago,

39
00:04:49,345 --> 00:04:50,665
I did see Xu Zhihong.

40
00:04:51,625 --> 00:04:52,905
When?

41
00:04:54,265 --> 00:04:55,905
It should've been

42
00:04:55,985 --> 00:04:57,425
before the Hong Kong handover.

43
00:04:57,505 --> 00:05:01,385
Back then, Xu Zhihong ran to 1713,

44
00:05:01,465 --> 00:05:04,185
Qihuang Clinic,
to argue with Zhang Ersong.

45
00:05:04,265 --> 00:05:07,105
I just happened to pass by and heard

46
00:05:07,625 --> 00:05:10,345
him shouting inside
about exposing something.

47
00:05:12,825 --> 00:05:14,385
This Zhang Ersong

48
00:05:14,465 --> 00:05:16,065
is Master Zhang from Qihuang Clinic.

49
00:05:16,145 --> 00:05:17,785
What Master Zhang?

50
00:05:18,465 --> 00:05:20,945
He's nothing but a con artist
who's done time.

51
00:05:21,025 --> 00:05:23,305
I'm from Langzhong, same as him.

52
00:05:23,905 --> 00:05:26,105
So Qihuang Clinic was shut down

53
00:05:26,185 --> 00:05:27,945
because Xu Zhihong exposed him?

54
00:05:28,025 --> 00:05:28,865
Shut down? Not at all.

55
00:05:28,945 --> 00:05:31,385
They just moved
to a bigger place to expand.

56
00:05:31,465 --> 00:05:33,465
Now it's a large clinic.

57
00:05:33,545 --> 00:05:35,025
What's it called?

58
00:05:35,105 --> 00:05:36,505
Songbentang.

59
00:05:40,665 --> 00:05:43,065
I've lived here for over 20 years.

60
00:05:43,145 --> 00:05:46,705
Back when Xu's mother was still alive,
we had some contact.

61
00:05:46,785 --> 00:05:48,825
Ever since Xu died in a mountain accident,

62
00:05:48,905 --> 00:05:50,985
he started borrowing money everywhere.

63
00:05:51,065 --> 00:05:52,625
I didn't dare keep in touch
with them anymore.

64
00:05:54,305 --> 00:05:55,505
Can you think back again,

65
00:05:56,105 --> 00:05:57,745
before the 1997 handover of Hong Kong,

66
00:05:57,825 --> 00:06:00,785
did anything unusual
happen in the Xu family?

67
00:06:01,825 --> 00:06:03,105
Unusual?

68
00:06:04,185 --> 00:06:05,985
Unusual…

69
00:06:07,785 --> 00:06:08,625
Yes, there was something unusual.

70
00:06:09,225 --> 00:06:12,945
It was a few days
before Hong Kong's handover.

71
00:06:33,865 --> 00:06:36,585
POWER OUTAGE NOTICE

72
00:06:44,665 --> 00:06:45,705
What's wrong, Uncle Wang?

73
00:06:46,585 --> 00:06:47,625
Xu,

74
00:06:48,145 --> 00:06:49,785
why is your place
making that banging noise?

75
00:06:51,465 --> 00:06:53,945
My dad wants to sell the big wardrobe.

76
00:06:54,025 --> 00:06:56,225
The doorway's too narrow.
Can't get it out.

77
00:06:56,305 --> 00:06:59,305
So I thought I'd chisel
the doorframe a bit.

78
00:06:59,385 --> 00:07:01,465
Why sell it?

79
00:07:02,705 --> 00:07:05,385
There's a qigong master in Yuanlongli

80
00:07:05,465 --> 00:07:06,985
who claims he can cure anything.

81
00:07:07,065 --> 00:07:08,345
He's just expensive.

82
00:07:08,425 --> 00:07:09,745
Oh…

83
00:07:10,705 --> 00:07:12,145
Uncle Wang,

84
00:07:12,225 --> 00:07:13,865
you…

85
00:07:13,945 --> 00:07:16,225
I've got mung bean soup cooking at home.

86
00:07:16,305 --> 00:07:17,425
It's going to burn.

87
00:07:17,505 --> 00:07:18,625
It's going to burn.

88
00:07:19,825 --> 00:07:20,705
It's burning…

89
00:07:32,785 --> 00:07:33,905
30TH MONDAY

90
00:07:36,745 --> 00:07:39,305
That wardrobe was still inside, not sold.

91
00:07:39,385 --> 00:07:42,305
The scrap collector came the next day

92
00:07:42,385 --> 00:07:44,785
and haggled with Xu for a long time.

93
00:07:44,865 --> 00:07:47,585
In the end, they didn't
reach a deal on the wardrobe,

94
00:07:47,665 --> 00:07:50,145
so he just took away
a bunch of jars and bottles.

95
00:07:54,985 --> 00:07:56,265
How about this?

96
00:07:56,945 --> 00:07:59,305
Call the person who hired you

97
00:07:59,985 --> 00:08:03,025
and tell him the 500 is up.

98
00:08:03,105 --> 00:08:04,425
Ask him to send you more.

99
00:08:06,625 --> 00:08:07,865
Do you have the number?

100
00:08:08,385 --> 00:08:09,305
Let me check.

101
00:08:12,225 --> 00:08:13,385
Still here.

102
00:08:14,665 --> 00:08:16,025
This one.

103
00:08:17,465 --> 00:08:18,705
A Guangdong number?

104
00:08:23,585 --> 00:08:25,505
I haven't called it in years.

105
00:08:27,585 --> 00:08:30,465
<i>Hello. The number you have dialed</i>
<i>is no longer in service.</i>

106
00:08:30,545 --> 00:08:32,745
<i>Please check and dial again.</i>

107
00:08:32,825 --> 00:08:34,745
<i>Sorry, the subscriber you dialed…</i>

108
00:08:34,825 --> 00:08:36,505
<i>Please check and dial again.</i>

109
00:08:37,625 --> 00:08:40,545
<i>Hello. The number you have dialed</i>
<i>is no longer in service.</i>

110
00:08:40,625 --> 00:08:42,305
<i>Please check and dial again.</i>

111
00:08:49,985 --> 00:08:53,065
<i>Hello. The number you have dialed</i>
<i>is no longer in service.</i>

112
00:08:53,145 --> 00:08:54,985
<i>Please check and dial again.</i>

113
00:08:56,825 --> 00:08:59,145
How did it become a dead number?

114
00:09:00,265 --> 00:09:02,705
Even this last bit of hope is gone.

115
00:09:04,985 --> 00:09:06,345
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

116
00:09:08,145 --> 00:09:11,025
<i>Freedom, freedom</i>

117
00:09:11,625 --> 00:09:14,825
<i>Close your eyes</i>
<i>And get a good night's sleep</i>

118
00:09:14,905 --> 00:09:17,865
<i>Run, run</i>
<i>Leave the past behind</i>

119
00:09:18,465 --> 00:09:21,305
<i>No matter the outcome, it doesn't matter</i>

120
00:09:27,105 --> 00:09:28,105
Why did it stop?

121
00:09:45,025 --> 00:09:47,225
Who let you sneak the instruments out?

122
00:09:49,225 --> 00:09:50,265
Dad,

123
00:09:50,865 --> 00:09:52,385
we just borrowed them for a bit.

124
00:09:53,065 --> 00:09:54,105
We'll take good care of them.

125
00:09:54,185 --> 00:09:54,865
SLOW

126
00:09:54,945 --> 00:09:55,945
Nothing will get damaged.

127
00:09:56,705 --> 00:09:57,625
What did I tell you?

128
00:09:58,425 --> 00:09:59,585
If you want to start a band,

129
00:09:59,665 --> 00:10:01,665
bring me a university
admission letter in exchange.

130
00:10:01,745 --> 00:10:03,425
Did you take that as nothing?

131
00:10:03,945 --> 00:10:05,425
Move everything back!

132
00:10:12,185 --> 00:10:13,505
I'll deal with you when you get home.

133
00:10:15,625 --> 00:10:16,665
Uncle.

134
00:10:19,185 --> 00:10:20,505
We've written a new song.

135
00:10:21,265 --> 00:10:22,265
Do you want to hear it?

136
00:10:22,865 --> 00:10:24,585
Maybe after you listen,

137
00:10:25,105 --> 00:10:26,825
you'll support our rock dream.

138
00:10:31,185 --> 00:10:33,065
Rock dream?

139
00:10:36,425 --> 00:10:37,545
Is that something
students should be doing?

140
00:10:39,265 --> 00:10:40,185
Look at you all,

141
00:10:40,265 --> 00:10:42,905
one worse than the next,
acting like hooligans.

142
00:10:42,985 --> 00:10:44,585
Instead of studying properly at home,

143
00:10:44,665 --> 00:10:45,785
you mess around all day.

144
00:10:45,865 --> 00:10:47,025
What future will you have?

145
00:10:49,625 --> 00:10:50,545
Are you moving it or not?

146
00:10:54,505 --> 00:10:55,905
Not moving it, right?

147
00:10:57,585 --> 00:10:58,345
Dad.

148
00:10:58,425 --> 00:10:59,825
-Let go.
-Don't grab it.

149
00:10:59,905 --> 00:11:01,665
-Let go.
-Don't grab it.

150
00:11:03,345 --> 00:11:04,305
Keyboard!

151
00:11:11,425 --> 00:11:14,185
PUBLIC SECURITY

152
00:11:14,265 --> 00:11:16,625
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

153
00:11:17,625 --> 00:11:20,425
Captain, before Han Zi'ang
injured someone,

154
00:11:20,505 --> 00:11:22,425
he was very likely attacked.

155
00:11:23,025 --> 00:11:24,985
Explain. How did you come
to that conclusion?

156
00:11:25,065 --> 00:11:27,465
When I went to Yuanlongli to investigate,

157
00:11:28,345 --> 00:11:29,505
I ran into my dad.

158
00:11:30,185 --> 00:11:31,025
He and Ran

159
00:11:33,865 --> 00:11:36,225
once carried out an immersive reenactment.

160
00:11:39,025 --> 00:11:41,385
I know my dad wasn't in the clearest
state of mind back then,

161
00:11:41,465 --> 00:11:44,065
but I believe Captain Ran's theory
is sound.

162
00:11:44,145 --> 00:11:45,505
The Han Zi'ang case

163
00:11:46,025 --> 00:11:47,665
is definitely more than just a prank.

164
00:11:49,065 --> 00:11:50,345
MODERN LAW ENFORCEMENT
UNWAVERING POLICE EXCELLENCE

165
00:11:52,185 --> 00:11:54,985
Yesterday, I also
made a pledge to the principal.

166
00:11:55,065 --> 00:11:56,025
Within a week,

167
00:11:56,105 --> 00:11:58,945
I'll prove that Han Zi'ang acted
in self defense.

168
00:11:59,025 --> 00:12:01,585
Otherwise, he'll be expelled.

169
00:12:02,105 --> 00:12:05,225
Captain, can you assign me more manpower?

170
00:12:10,705 --> 00:12:11,985
Xiaohe,

171
00:12:12,065 --> 00:12:15,105
I understand how you feel.

172
00:12:15,185 --> 00:12:16,305
You want to find the truth

173
00:12:16,385 --> 00:12:17,865
and help Han Zi'ang.

174
00:12:17,945 --> 00:12:19,985
But the situation in the unit,
you should know it too.

175
00:12:20,065 --> 00:12:22,105
Those four kids still haven't been found.

176
00:12:22,625 --> 00:12:25,785
Everyone… Right now, everyone
is tied up with the task force.

177
00:12:25,865 --> 00:12:27,665
You're relying on Mr. He and Ran…

178
00:12:29,305 --> 00:12:31,265
Just on a few of Mr. He's deductions,

179
00:12:31,345 --> 00:12:33,385
with no evidence, no leads.

180
00:12:33,465 --> 00:12:34,865
Then tell me,

181
00:12:34,945 --> 00:12:36,505
how am I supposed to ask
the task force for people?

182
00:12:55,065 --> 00:12:56,945
FREE REFILLS, HELP YOURSELF

183
00:13:02,665 --> 00:13:03,505
Why the long face?

184
00:13:07,305 --> 00:13:09,065
Is the cafeteria food that bad?

185
00:13:10,705 --> 00:13:12,625
It's not bad,

186
00:13:12,705 --> 00:13:13,905
it just feels awful.

187
00:13:16,785 --> 00:13:17,785
The Han Zi'ang case?

188
00:13:21,345 --> 00:13:22,625
I don't have a single lead right now.

189
00:13:22,705 --> 00:13:24,865
And my dad keeps making things worse.

190
00:13:24,945 --> 00:13:26,945
This is my first case.

191
00:13:27,945 --> 00:13:29,505
If only Uncle Ran were here,

192
00:13:30,145 --> 00:13:32,225
he'd never let me turn in a blank.

193
00:13:32,305 --> 00:13:34,265
In the whole Nanshan Branch,

194
00:13:34,345 --> 00:13:37,145
people who say that
could line up to the gate.

195
00:13:38,505 --> 00:13:41,145
When you handle cases,
if all you do is rely on Captain Ran,

196
00:13:41,865 --> 00:13:43,065
then do you know,

197
00:13:43,145 --> 00:13:44,985
back then, Captain Ran
also had someone he relied on?

198
00:13:45,065 --> 00:13:46,105
Who?

199
00:13:46,625 --> 00:13:48,185
Someone even more impressive
than Uncle Ran?

200
00:13:48,905 --> 00:13:51,305
One time after working late,
I went for a late-night snack

201
00:13:51,825 --> 00:13:53,465
and ran into your Uncle Ran
at the entrance.

202
00:13:53,545 --> 00:13:55,465
He seemed troubled.

203
00:13:56,225 --> 00:13:58,625
That was the first time I saw him drink.

204
00:14:00,265 --> 00:14:01,545
He told me

205
00:14:02,145 --> 00:14:04,345
the person he respected most
from the bottom of his heart

206
00:14:05,905 --> 00:14:07,225
was your dad.

207
00:14:09,265 --> 00:14:11,625
He also said, if not for your dad,

208
00:14:11,705 --> 00:14:14,145
he wouldn't have made it
this far so smoothly.

209
00:14:14,225 --> 00:14:16,265
He might not have even gotten through
his very first case.

210
00:14:18,225 --> 00:14:19,705
When did that happen?

211
00:14:21,265 --> 00:14:22,785
Around 2002, I think.

212
00:14:26,305 --> 00:14:27,505
Time flies.

213
00:14:30,585 --> 00:14:32,425
It's been 12 years
since Captain Ran passed.

214
00:14:37,785 --> 00:14:39,745
If you want to look
into Han Zi'ang's case,

215
00:14:40,265 --> 00:14:41,865
you'd better ask
the experts from Yuanlongli.

216
00:14:42,665 --> 00:14:43,945
There are two experts in the unit.

217
00:14:44,545 --> 00:14:46,065
One was Captain Ran back then,

218
00:14:46,585 --> 00:14:48,305
and the other is your dad.

